OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fpersistent rain tonight, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes into the early hours of Friday.
OL,8,FBecoming much milder than last night
OL,9,Fand turning windy with strong gusts
OL,10,Fdeveloping over hills and along
OL,11,Fexposed coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FRain, sometimes heavy, will
OL,14,Fclear through Friday morning to become
OL,15,Fbright with scattered showers. Windy
OL,16,Fwith gales through the morning over
OL,17,Fthe hills, easing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
