OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Fchilly start on Saturday with
OL,7,Fscattered showers and sunny spells.
OL,8,FShowers easing into Sunday, then
OL,9,Fcloudier and milder on Monday with
OL,10,Fsome rain and drizzle possible.
